    "description": "The Loyalty Earn Batch Insertion API facilitates the streamlined process of awarding loyalty points to customers in bulk. This endpoint allows businesses to efficiently record multiple earn entries for loyalty programs, fostering enhanced customer engagement and retention. Typically used by loyalty program managers and marketing teams, the API supports scenarios where large volumes of earn transactions need to be processed simultaneously, contributing to a seamless user experience. Given its batch processing capability, this API is essential for businesses looking to automate and optimize their loyalty point distribution.",
